est Tropical works with the highest quality materials, ranging from cell cast acrylic to tempered glass. And our advanced fabricating techniques assure our clients of many years of performance, safety, and reliability. To ensure our <a href="/waterwalls/water-displays/">water features</a> stand the test of time, your project manager will recommend the appropriate materials for your project based upon budget, durability needs and environmental conditions. Some options include: cell cast acrylic, natural stones, tempered glass, mosaic tiles, stainless and copper metals, and much more. Let us help you design and hand fabricate your next <a href="/materials/wire-mesh-water-features-2/">water wall</a>, <a href="/bubble-walls/">bubble wall</a>, <a href="/products/bubble-tubes/">bubble tube, </a><a href="/rain-curtains/">rain curtain</a>, <a href="/products/">water fountain</a>, water-based display, <a href="/products/reflection-pools/">reflection pool</a>, or other, mostly water-based, large-scale organic art installations. Because our years of experience crafting and installing thousands of water features across the globe and record of innovation, you will be glad you did.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-f523d7c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="f523d7c" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-16 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a606776" data-id="a606776" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-438450d elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="438450d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image-